[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/morrowind/mods/54976]Take Cover[/url] by mym - a nice immersion mod that handles enemies fleeing and hiding when they can't reach the player.
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/morrowind/mods/55059]One-handed animations and idle fixes[/url] by me - makes NPCs look less stupid when they use one-handed weapons (used in the gifs above).
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/morrowind/mods/52596]ReAnimation[/url] also by me - a good set of first-person animations (if I can say so myself, wink-wink, nudge-nudge) to make the combat feel even more dynamic and less repetitive.
[/list]

